<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Zsh on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/zsh/</link><description>Recent content in Zsh on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 10:43:10 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/zsh/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Zsh Config Files and Priority</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2023/20230508-zprofile-zshrc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 10:43:10 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2023/20230508-zprofile-zshrc/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://einverne.github.io/post/2023/01/zprofile-zshrc.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Zsh Config Files and Priority&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="zsh-environment-variable-config-files"&gt;Zsh environment variable config files:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zprofile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zlogin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zshrc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zshenv&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zlogout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;.zshrc is used for overall shell customization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zprofile and .zlogin are similar. They both set environment variables for login shells, but their load timing differs. .zprofile is based on Bash&amp;rsquo;s .bash_profile, while .zlogin is the CSH-style .login legacy name.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zshrc sets environment variables for interactive shells. It loads after .zprofile. Typically used for $PATH, $PROMPT, aliases, functions, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zshenv is always read, so you can set environment variables like $PATH or $EDITOR there, but it is generally not used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.zlogout is loaded when a session logs out, which is good for cleanup, such as resetting terminal titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zsh loads ~/.zprofile at login (login shell).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Zsh tab-completion not working</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211210-zsh-tab-completion-not-working/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Dec 2021 17:44:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211210-zsh-tab-completion-not-working/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46939906/zsh-tab-completion-not-working" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Zsh tab-completion not working&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id="question"&gt;Question&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Although I&amp;rsquo;ve used Oh-My-Zsh in the past, I decided this time around (i.e. setting up a new computer) I&amp;rsquo;d try to avoid installing it to keep things a bit leaner. Right now I&amp;rsquo;m trying to cherry-pick Oh-My-Zsh&amp;rsquo;s insensitive tab-completion feature. Digging around its source repo, I found the following line:
&lt;code&gt;zstyle ':completion:*' matcher-list 'm:{a-zA-Z}={A-Za-z}' 'r:|=*' 'l:|=* r:|=*'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m fairly confident this is the line Oh-My-Zsh executes to do what I want, so I tried adding it to my &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;. Restarted my terminal. Typed &lt;code&gt;cd desk&lt;/code&gt;, then hit [tab]. No dice &amp;ndash; I didn&amp;rsquo;t get &lt;code&gt;cd Desktop/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Super easy! Build a beautiful and handy zsh terminal</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211009-zsh/</link><pubDate>Thu, 07 Oct 2021 08:44:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211009-zsh/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@white1033/%E8%B6%85%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE-%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E6%BC%82%E4%BA%AE%E5%8F%88%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84-zsh-%E7%B5%82%E7%AB%AF%E7%92%B0%E5%A2%83-c81874368264" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Super easy! Build a beautiful and handy zsh terminal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://dwye.dev/post/zsh-zim-powerlevel10k/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Make your terminal stylish and fast with zsh + zim + powerlevel10k&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://medium.com/starbugs/%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0-10x-engineer-zsh-shell-97e40db76391" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Build a 10X Engineer shell environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>I can feel the speed — optimize zsh and oh my zsh cold start</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210715-make-oh-my-zsh-fly/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Jul 2021 18:19:06 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210715-make-oh-my-zsh-fly/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.skk.moe/post/make-oh-my-zsh-fly/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;I can feel the speed — optimize zsh and oh my zsh cold start&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id="profiling"&gt;Profiling&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-b7485982f226e580603f2d9125c306cf-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# .zshrc&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;zmodload zsh/zprof
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# .zshrc\nzmodload zsh/zprof\n","title":"shell"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-b7485982f226e580603f2d9125c306cf-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ /bin/zsh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ zprof
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;num calls &lt;span class="nb"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt; self name
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 1&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 395.66 395.66 33.10% 395.59 395.59 33.09% _zsh_nvm_auto_use
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 2&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 216.22 216.22 18.09% 216.13 216.13 18.08% nvm_die_on_prefix
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 3&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 648.00 648.00 54.20% 168.85 168.85 14.12% nvm_auto
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 4&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; 479.15 239.57 40.08% 160.50 80.25 13.43% nvm
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 5&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 102.30 102.30 8.56% 84.99 84.99 7.11% nvm_ensure_version_installed
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 6&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; 51.21 25.60 4.28% 29.55 14.78 2.47% compinit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 7&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 680.18 680.18 56.89% 22.17 22.17 1.85% _zsh_nvm_load
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 8&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; 21.66 10.83 1.81% 21.66 10.83 1.81% compaudit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; 9&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 17.31 17.31 1.45% 17.31 17.31 1.45% nvm_is_version_installed
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;10&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;193&lt;/span&gt; 17.43 0.09 1.46% 14.50 0.08 1.21% _zsh_autosuggest_bind_widget
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;Redacted&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
