&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"$ /bin/zsh\n$ zprof\n\nnum calls time self name\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n 1) 1 395.66 395.66 33.10% 395.59 395.59 33.09% _zsh_nvm_auto_use\n 2) 1 216.22 216.22 18.09% 216.13 216.13 18.08% nvm_die_on_prefix\n 3) 1 648.00 648.00 54.20% 168.85 168.85 14.12% nvm_auto\n 4) 2 479.15 239.57 40.08% 160.50 80.25 13.43% nvm\n 5) 1 102.30 102.30 8.56% 84.99 84.99 7.11% nvm_ensure_version_installed\n 6) 2 51.21 25.60 4.28% 29.55 14.78 2.47% compinit\n 7) 1 680.18 680.18 56.89% 22.17 22.17 1.85% _zsh_nvm_load\n 8) 2 21.66 10.83 1.81% 21.66 10.83 1.81% compaudit\n 9) 1 17.31 17.31 1.45% 17.31 17.31 1.45% nvm_is_version_installed\n10) 193 17.43 0.09 1.46% 14.50 0.08 1.21% _zsh_autosuggest_bind_widget\n[Redacted]\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;zprof&lt;/code&gt; module only reports the time for each zsh function, so it is useful for finding oh-my-zsh plugins that slow down cold start. To profile the entire &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;, use &lt;code&gt;xtrace&lt;/code&gt;. Add the following at the top of &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Let Zsh read macOS system proxy settings and set env vars</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210111-macos-auto-read-proxy-settings-zsh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 14:50:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210111-macos-auto-read-proxy-settings-zsh/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.skk.moe/post/macos-auto-read-proxy-settings-zsh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Let Zsh read macOS system proxy settings and set env vars&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-1d58b3ab1302e5626d148dc6f3fce080-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-zsh" data-lang="zsh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ system_profiler SPNetworkDataType &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# get full network configuration&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ networksetup -listallnetworkservices &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# list all network services&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ networksetup -getwebproxy Wi-Fi &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# get system proxy settings for a specific service&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ scutil --proxy &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# get enabled proxy settings (wrapper for system_profiler)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"$ system_profiler SPNetworkDataType # get full network configuration\n\n$ networksetup -listallnetworkservices # list all network services\n$ networksetup -getwebproxy Wi-Fi # get system proxy settings for a specific service\n\n$ scutil --proxy # get enabled proxy settings (wrapper for system_profiler)\n","title":"zsh"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>